{"word":"ἄρρητος","uri":"arrhêtos","senses":[{"word":"ἄρρητος","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">ἄ·ρρητος,</span></span> <span class=\"des\">ος,\nον</span> :\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> dont on n’a pas parlé,\n<span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> <span class=\"ital\">au\npropre,</span> non dit : <span class=\"grec\">ἀλλ’ οὐκ ἐπ’\nἀρρήτοις γε τοῖς ἐμοῖς λόγοις,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ant.</span> <span class=\"refch\">556,</span> mais ce n’est pas du moins que je ne t’aie pas\ndit ce que j’avais à te dire ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> dont on ne parle pas,\ninconnu, <span class=\"ital\">en parl. de pers.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hés.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">O.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">en parl. de choses,</span>\nsecret, <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">14,\n466 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Conv.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">189</span><span class=\"refpb\">b</span> ||</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">II</span> qu’on ne doit pas\ndivulguer, mystérieux, sacré, <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">5, 83 ;</span> <span class=\"refch\">6,\n135 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">O.R.</span> <span class=\"refch\">301 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Nub.</span> <span class=\"refch\">302,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">en parl. de Dèmèter et de Korè</span> (<span class=\"ital\">Proserpine</span>) <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">fr. 64,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span>\n||</div>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">III</span> qu’on ne peut\nexprimer par la parole, indicible, inexprimable, <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"refpa\"